# Testing

Follow `documentation/TESTING_GUIDELINES.md`. Every new feature, behavior change, or bug fix includes tests.

Cover:

- Happy path
- Failure and edge cases
- Authorization or permission logic when the change is gated

Use feature-based file names (`App.[feature].test.js`, `ComponentName.test.js`, `helperName.test.js`). Reuse `src/tests/__mocks__/fetchMocks.js` instead of inventing a new mock layer.

Use the `write-tests` skill when adding or reshaping the suite.
